WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.700
An if runs its blocks only when its question is true.

2
00:00:04.479 --> 00:00:08.879
In on start, the question is asked once, before the game begins.

3
00:00:09.684 --> 00:00:14.534
In on game update, it's asked every frame, about 30 times a second.

4
00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:21.115
To keep checking something, put the if in on game update.
